    [
     1,
     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\">\r\n    for one thing, I think you have a scoping issue- h is initialized\r\n    within the loop and only exists in the environment briefly created\r\n    by the loop. <br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    second, I think you need to have separate reactive expressions for\r\n    1) the HTML and 2) the plot, both observing when the button is\r\n    pressed.</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\"><br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <div>On 5/9/15 5:52 AM, Mark wrote:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    </div>"
    ],
